[{"client_msg_id":"bce6b2d8-6724-4d9a-9d78-5cad1e84956f","type":"message","user":"UNJ2DANJC","text":"隠居はちょっと古い言い方かなあ\n最近は老後をゆったり過ごす的なことは庶民には許されない事が多い\n70過ぎて80近くてもバリバリ働いてる人結構いる","ts":"1615774001.030800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"totemoturai","count":4,"users":["U81LLJ340","UL6CFN8NR","U01EMNN9XNG","U01BY3SDBRS"]},{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U01EMNN9XNG"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AMr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0be43193-0eb8-4933-8f8e-10de66b84c11","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"世間から見た「隠れている」か自分から見て「世間全体から隠れている」くらいなのかでちょっと違うかな\nでもたしかに","ts":"1615771467.028500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pIfv7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4cc8aa5e-bcb3-42b5-8235-5554170681d4","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"隠居は「隠れて居る」なので、目立たず穏やかな居住にシフトすることに焦点があたってる表現だと思ってました。第一線を退くイメージもありますね。","ts":"1615771253.027700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=33AK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fa85d5b5-6619-4005-aa32-77999b11e951","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"隠居は、むしろ第一線を退くが主題で、それに付随して「他でがんばるとかは薄い」ので結果として、老後のイメージなんでしょうね...\nただ退職、引退という言葉があるので、仕事やスポーツだとそっちになるし、逆にそう書かない場合とのニュアンスの差がでるしなあ...隠居してエンジョイもなくはないんだが、退職してエンジョイとか引退してエンジョイとかよりは穏やかなイメージはあるもんなw","ts":"1615770885.025600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U01EMNN9XNG"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NDu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6d59d73a-2a5a-4bc8-915d-08c70020df2e","type":"message","user":"U01EMNN9XNG","text":"（スポーツに詳しくはないんですけど…","ts":"1615769588.022400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jjY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f35e1485-ae3e-4d10-ab1a-9bb234cb76b2","type":"message","user":"U01EMNN9XNG","text":"確かに、スポーツ選手の引退も、仕事からの退職も、英語では\"retirement\"と言いますね。なるほど","ts":"1615769575.022100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=fy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"56b1a074-fc26-4546-b6da-0f57357f249b","type":"message","user":"U01EMNN9XNG","text":"和英辞典では、3つも\"retirement\"だったので","ts":"1615769491.021100","edited":{"user":"U01EMNN9XNG","ts":"1615769499.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"t+f"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3aafdd78-9149-4a3d-9e30-6f4bd8fea901","type":"message","user":"U01EMNN9XNG","text":":naruhodo:","ts":"1615769476.020700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kTa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"FC14C109-9EA2-4494-8614-63F6FCDBDBE6","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"第一線から退くのも隠居らしい","ts":"1615769339.020500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pxbX9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5BCB2F02-589A-4233-9FDF-2867A2A599D8","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"\u003chttps://ja.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%9A%A0%E5%B1%85|https://ja.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/隠居\u003e","ts":"1615769319.019900","attachments":[{"fallback":"wikipedia: 隠居","id":1,"author_name":"Wikipedia","author_link":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/","title":"隠居","title_link":"https://ja.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%9A%A0%E5%B1%85","text":"隠居（いんきょ）は、戸主が家督を他の者に譲ること。または家督に限らず、それまであった立場などを他人に譲って、自らは悠々自適の生活を送ることなどを指す。もしくは、第一線から退くことなど。隠退（いんたい）とも。\n日本の民法上の制度としての隠居は、戸主が生前に家督を相続人へ譲ることを指し、日本国憲法の施行に伴う民法の応急的措置に関する法律（昭和22年法律第74号）により、日本国憲法の施行（1947年5月3日）と同時に、戸主制の廃止と共に隠居の制度は廃止された。","blocks":null,"service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/wikipedia.png","from_url":"https://ja.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%9A%A0%E5%B1%85","original_url":"https://ja.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%9A%A0%E5%B1%85"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"g8T"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7d029fcb-4400-4726-a5aa-9286ce484ee1","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"なので例えば退職後に別の企業に再就職する場合は隠居とは言わないと思います","ts":"1615769305.019700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wAP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"212a19b3-a47e-419f-8ed9-28c75e85858b","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"隠居は「退職・引退して、老後を穏やかな生活で過ごすこと」というイメージです。","ts":"1615769272.019000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rql"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5DBCD8F6-08F8-4CD3-B54C-BE94CEFABE0E","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"隠居は難しいすね","ts":"1615769247.018500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Y4+I"}]},{"client_msg_id":"BC57A70C-D154-43B4-A3DE-4611E83DA316","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"退職は仕事関連","ts":"1615769236.018200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6FHd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"905C50D4-8EFB-4983-9E73-992BD4A1B454","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"引退は主にスポーツが浮かびますね","ts":"1615769225.017700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=MB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"52a9eef8-2da3-43d7-9d4b-6786c2504007","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"退職は職を退くことなので仕事にのみ使われますが、引退は色々ありますね。スポーツ選手は基本的に「引退」です。","ts":"1615769173.016500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3mWAX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6e748971-5e24-4b9c-babd-fd333370d12f","type":"message","user":"U01EMNN9XNG","text":"退職・引退・隠居\nってニュアンス的に違いがあるんでしょうか？","ts":"1615769079.015200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UR=o"}]},{"client_msg_id":"15eabbee-56a1-4946-aa8f-2ec730bc944b","type":"message","user":"UGJG6S9JM","text":"シャドーイングかどうかはわからないけれど、映画のセリフの復唱とかはやってたかなあ。ちょっと楽しい。\nなお、Starwarsみたいなやつじゃ意味がないのでそうじゃない映画で…\n定型文みたいなの見えてきて、喋ることに抵抗が減るとは思う。","ts":"1615748331.013600","edited":{"user":"UGJG6S9JM","ts":"1615748374.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"P=Gq"}]}]
